cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "relapse-competence"
abstract: >-
  Longitudinal cfDNA modelling for the relapse-competent state, with an
  executable evidence chain. Reproduces the Poisson floor of ctDNA detection,
  compares tumour-informed MRD and sequential detection under held-out
  threshold calibration, and reports lead time against the published bar.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-06"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/rollroyces/relapse-competence"
url: "https://github.com/rollroyces/relapse-competence"
authors:
  - family-names: Lam
    given-names: Royce
keywords:
  - cfDNA
  - MRD
  - liquid biopsy
  - relapse
  - longitudinal monitoring
